        "description": "Takes JSON with annual_fee, years and hostel (true or false). Returns the total cost.",
        "jsCode": "  const input = JSON.parse(query);\n  const hostelFee = input.hostel ? 60000 : 0;\n  const perYear = Number(input.annual_fee) + hostelFee;\n  const total = perYear * Number(input.years);\n  return JSON.stringify({ per_year: perYear, total: total });"
